I wake up early today.
The spring sun shines brightly into the flat.
It is finally spring in Berlin.
I get up and go into the kitchen.
I make myself a coffee.
The coffee smells wonderful.
I sit at the kitchen table.
I drink the coffee slowly.
The morning is very quiet.
I enjoy the quiet morning.
I look out of the window.
The sky is completely blue.
Then I pack my things for the office.
I pack my laptop into my backpack.
The backpack is ready.
I do not need a winter jacket today.
I only put on my thin jacket.
I take my keys.
Then I leave the flat.
